      "message": "fix(mcp): set_lathe_tool_body tip is mm in the model frame after import\n\nThe tip schema said \"the file's length unit read as mm\", but an inch or\nmetre STEP is scaled to mm on import and the placement reads those mm\nfacets; an agent following the old text would misplace the tip 25.4x on\nan inch STEP. Same wording in the camcraft-mcp skill row. PROCESS_VERSION\n31 (main is at 30).\n\nRefs #361\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
